# Enumerating variants missed anything not named exactly `.env`/`.env.local`.
# Hit for real on 2026-07-27: a `.env.bak-preminio` written while repointing
# object storage was NOT ignored and would have committed live Supabase service
# credentials. Default to ignoring every .env* and opt the template back in.
.env*
!.env.example
playwright-report/
test-results/
.DS_Store

# sigmap — regenerate with `pnpm map`; these are derived, not source
.context/
.sigmap-cache.json
AGENTS.md
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.github/gemini-context.md

# sqz — local token-savings log
.sqz/

# self-learning loop — transient per-session state (LEARNED.md itself is tracked)
.claude/learned/.state/
captures/

# pals-hydrate-export CLI output — regenerated every batch, not source
apps/worker/pals-hydrate-seed.json

# Checked-out worktrees are copies of this repo, not content to track.
# Also ignored by eslint (see eslint.config.mjs) for the same reason:
# linting them reports every finding a second time against identical source.
.worktrees/
